      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.829999923706055,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.0,
      642.41,
      542.48,
      679.88
    ],
    "text": "Monthly total sewerage charge of any premises includes usage charges, monthly service charges, other charges and applicable taxes. Water bill generally displays only the total monthly sewerage charge and if necessary consumer can request the water bill with separate VAT/SVAT Invoices with prior registration with the National Water Supply and Drainage Board.",
